Description: Native Linux desktop client for Buffer publishing
 PostBop is a GTK4 and libadwaita desktop application that makes
 it easy to send posts, drafts, and ideas to Buffer.
 .
 It supports multiple publishing channels, image and link attachments,
 character-limit validation, and composer recovery.